<<tag character:Narrator>>
<<tag lore_id:lore_cathedral_tallymarks>>
Narrator: The basement wall is scored with tally marks, scratched in clusters of five, then crossed.
Narrator: Sixteen full clusters. The seventeenth is incomplete — four marks, no slash.
Narrator: Underneath, in a less steady hand: "Hour seventeen. Then the door."
Narrator: A candle stub waits on the floor below, its wick fresh, the wax still warm to the touch.
Narrator: Someone has been counting down here. Someone has not yet finished.
===
